flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Input[Receive upper limit]
    Input --> Valid{Whole number from 1 to 1000000?}
    Valid -->|No| Error[Report invalid limit]
    Error --> End([End])
    Valid -->|Yes| Init[Create empty primes list]
    Init --> Candidate[Set candidate to 2]
    Candidate --> WithinLimit{Candidate at most limit?}
    WithinLimit -->|No| Return[Return primes list]
    Return --> End
    WithinLimit -->|Yes| Divisor[Set divisor to 2]
    Divisor --> CheckDivisor{Divisor squared at most candidate?}
    CheckDivisor -->|No| Add[Add candidate to primes list]
    Add --> NextCandidate[Increase candidate by 1]
    CheckDivisor -->|Yes| Divisible{Candidate divisible by divisor?}
    Divisible -->|Yes| NextCandidate
    Divisible -->|No| NextDivisor[Increase divisor by 1]
    NextDivisor --> CheckDivisor
    NextCandidate --> WithinLimit
